# Backend and workers

- Convert in isolated Python workers, never in a Next.js request handler.
- Inspect with PyMuPDF, reconstruct with pdf2docx, then validate native editable text.
- No silent OCR. Empty or omitted-page output is `output_invalid`.
- Workers: non-root, no egress, per-job temp, 120s cap, one infra retry.
- Enforce size/page/signature on the server. MIME and extension are not enough.
- Do not ship a worker image before `ADR-003` has a license route.
